  "name": "Transfix",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Your alluring appearance captivates a creature within 60 ft: CHA save or it's Charmed and Incapacitated while you concentrate (up to 1 minute). On its turn it moves toward you by the most direct route (move it by hand); if it ends its turn within 5 ft of you, it takes 4d8 Psychic damage (automatic; +1d8 per slot level above 7). As a Magic action on later turns, Transfix Another creature (not one that already succeeded).</p>",
